g verbindt gerechten die eerder online verschenen met nieuwe recepten. Het is een kookboek voor de keuken, met uiteenlopende bereidingen die laten zien hoeveel richtingen vegetarisch koken kan hebben.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL45094754W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p442485131","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p452308666"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","reference":"work:1607","note":"Veggilaine/GhislaineVoogd9789000394975DutchHardcover vegetarianrecipebook. Practicalnonfiction; metadatarepairdoesnotmakeitnarrative/tastetesteligible.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-016.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL45094754W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p442485131","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p452308666"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL61503623M","isbn13":"9789000394975","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","note":"Source-bound bulk attempt yielded no verified importedasset. Preserve existing resolver and require actualfrontor documentedneutralplaceholder hosted. This is neitherbookabsence nor a repairedcover.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15205651,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-046"}},{"ref":"m6","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":987245009},"before":null,"after":{"edition_