ie in Nederland moeilijk toegang krijgen tot zorg en opvang. Op haar spreekuur ziet zij hoe ziekte samenhangt met bestaansonzekerheid en hoe regels hulp kunnen vertragen. Vanuit die concrete ontmoetingen onderzoekt ze de inrichting van het zorgstelsel. Haar ervaringen vormen de basis voor een kritisch betoog over verantwoordelijkheid en praktische hulp. Het boek vraagt wat er gebeurt wanneer de organisatie rond zorg belangrijker lijkt te worden dan degene die ondersteuning nodig heeft.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42143816W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p443842515"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","reference":"work:1829","note":"KomtEenLandBijDeDokter MichelleVanTongerloo9789493254527 exactDutchPaperback, streetdoctorreports/authorpolicycritique, no inventedmedicalefficacyfacts.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-016.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42143816W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p443842515"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL57189690M","isbn13":"9789493254527","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","note":"Source-bound bulk attempt yielded no verified importedasset. Preserve existing resolver and require actualfrontor documentedneutralplaceholder hosted. This is neitherbookabsence nor a repairedcover.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":14828990,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","