efore":null,"after":{"work_id":987145018,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":977300024,"text":"Een vondst van NASA lijkt bewijs te leveren voor leven buiten de aarde. In de aanloop naar de Amerikaanse presidentsverkiezingen krijgt die ontdekking onmiddellijk politieke betekenis. Inlichtingenanalist Rachel Sexton wordt betrokken bij de controle van het bewijsmateriaal, samen met andere deskundigen. Haar vader voert juist campagne tegen de zittende president, die voordeel kan hebben van het nieuws. Terwijl Rachel probeert vast te stellen wat er werkelijk is gevonden, raken wetenschappelijke beoordeling en politieke belangen steeds nauwer verweven.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL76835W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p290935903"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","reference":"work:3274","note":"DeceptionPoint2001=DeDeltaDeceptie9789024549832, DanBrownDutchPaperback, RachelSexton/NASApremise independentlybound, notDaVinciCode.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-020.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL76835W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p290935903"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL9087213M","isbn13":"9789024549832","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:19:36.616Z","note":"Source-bound bulk attempt yielded no verified importedasset. Preserve existing resolver and require actualfrontor documentedneutralplaceholder hosted. This is neitherbookabsence nor a repairedcover.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":10659130,"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; n